4. Used React.lazy for dynamic importing
5. Added a loading fallback state
6. Moved mock components to be defined as constants rather than inline functions
7. Improved the structure of mock implementations

These changes should help resolve the "Failed to fetch dynamically imported module" error by:
- Properly handling dynamic imports
- Providing fallback content while loading
- Better error handling for failed imports
- More robust mocking strategy

The component should now load properly with appropriate fallbacks in case of any issues.

