4. Added a `mockedModules` export that other components can use if needed
5. Kept the core functionality while removing the dependency on Jest
6. Maintained the same mock components but implemented them in a way that works in a browser environment

These changes should resolve the "jest is not defined" error while still providing the necessary mocked functionality for the preview component. The component will now render with mock implementations without requiring Jest.

The mock components maintain the same structure and functionality as before, but they're implemented in a way that works in a browser environment rather than a test environment.

